{
  "version": 1,
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": "shiba_default_1",
      "residentId": "01_shiba",
      "text": "わんわん！おさんぽだいすきわん！",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "shiba_default_2",
      "residentId": "01_shiba",
      "text": "家事や庭の手入れにも、体を動かす機会があるんだね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "shiba_default_3",
      "residentId": "01_shiba",
      "text": "好きな遊びや趣味を、長く楽しめるといいね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "shiba_default_4",
      "residentId": "01_shiba",
      "text": "身近な人とのつながりも、大切にしたいね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "rabbit_default_1",
      "residentId": "02_rabbit",
      "text": "新しいことを知る楽しさも、ずっと大切にしたいね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "rabbit_default_2",
      "residentId": "02_rabbit",
      "text": "外に出るきっかけは、好きな場所を見つけることでもよさそう。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "rabbit_default_3",
      "residentId": "02_rabbit",
      "text": "体を動かす方法は、ひとつじゃないんだって。自分に合うものを。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "rabbit_default_4",
      "residentId": "02_rabbit",
      "text": "誰かと一緒だと、楽しめる活動もあるかもしれないね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "penguin_default_1",
      "residentId": "03_penguin",
      "text": "今日はどこにお出かけする？ ぼく、おすすめの場所を知ってるよ！",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "penguin_default_2",
      "residentId": "03_penguin",
      "text": "無理のない範囲で、楽しめる動き方を探してみたいね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "penguin_default_3",
      "residentId": "03_penguin",
      "text": "人と話す時間も、日々のつながりを育てるひとときだね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "penguin_default_4",
      "residentId": "03_penguin",
      "text": "自分が大切にしたいことを続けられる環境も、大事なんだって。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "cat_default_1",
      "residentId": "04_cat",
      "text": "暮らしの中で体を動かすことも、大切な活動なんだって。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "cat_default_2",
      "residentId": "04_cat",
      "text": "無理のない範囲で、楽しめる動き方を探してみたいね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "cat_default_3",
      "residentId": "04_cat",
      "text": "人と話す時間も、日々のつながりを育てるひとときだね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "cat_default_4",
      "residentId": "04_cat",
      "text": "自分が大切にしたいことを続けられる環境も、大事なんだって。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "squirrel_default_1",
      "residentId": "05_squirrel",
      "text": "少し体を動かすことも、毎日のセルフケアになるんだって。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "squirrel_default_2",
      "residentId": "05_squirrel",
      "text": "家事や庭の手入れにも、体を動かす機会があるんだね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "squirrel_default_3",
      "residentId": "05_squirrel",
      "text": "好きな遊びや趣味を、長く楽しめるといいね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "squirrel_default_4",
      "residentId": "05_squirrel",
      "text": "身近な人とのつながりも、大切にしたいね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bear_default_1",
      "residentId": "06_bear",
      "text": "年齢が同じでも、できることや必要な支えは人それぞれだね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bear_default_2",
      "residentId": "06_bear",
      "text": "支えを借りながらでも、自分の好きなことを楽しめるといいね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bear_default_3",
      "residentId": "06_bear",
      "text": "学んだり、人とつながったりすることも、生活する力のひとつだね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bear_default_4",
      "residentId": "06_bear",
      "text": "体調や暮らしに合う、自分なりのセルフケアを大切にしたいね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "shiba_sakura_outside_5",
      "residentId": "01_shiba",
      "text": "桜の季節だね！最近のお散歩はどうだった？",
      "priority": 20,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "date",
          "mode": "annual_range",
          "start": "03-20",
          "end": "04-10"
        },
        {
          "type": "mission",
          "missionId": "outside",
          "minCount": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "rabbit_new_year",
      "residentId": "02_rabbit",
      "text": "あけましておめでとう！今年も一緒に小さな一歩を楽しもうね。",
      "priority": 30,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "date",
          "mode": "annual",
          "date": "01-01"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "shiba_five_actions",
      "residentId": "01_shiba",
      "text": "もう5回もミッションを達成したんだね！えらいワン！",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": true,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "mission",
          "missionId": "all",
          "minCount": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "009_chef_001",
      "residentId": "009_chef",
      "text": "きのこには食物繊維がたっぷりにゃ！いろんな種類を食べると、食卓も楽しくなるにゃ〜！",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "009_chef_002",
      "residentId": "009_chef",
      "text": "旬の食べものは、おいしくて、お財布にもやさしいことが多いんだにゃ！季節の味を楽しんでみようにゃ♪",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "009_chef_003",
      "residentId": "009_chef",
      "text": "葉っぱのお野菜が高いときは、冷凍のお野菜でもいいんだにゃ。旬のものにこだわりすぎず、おいしく食べられるものを選ぼうにゃ！",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "009_chef_004",
      "residentId": "009_chef",
      "text": "食事をひとつ整えたの、もう5回目なんだにゃ！小さな工夫をコツコツ重ねてきたんだにゃ。すてきだにゃ〜！シェフから大きな花まるをあげるにゃ！🌸",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "mission",
          "missionId": "food",
          "minCount": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "026_farmer_001",
      "residentId": "026_farmer",
      "text": "畑仕事もいい運動になるんじゃよ。",
      "priority": 50,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "027_daydreamer_001",
      "residentId": "027_daydreamer",
      "text": "ぼく？なんにもしないをしてるんだよ。",
      "priority": 40,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "026_farmer_002",
      "residentId": "026_farmer",
      "text": "おやすみくん。農業をやらんかね。",
      "priority": 100,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "townTogether",
          "otherResidentId": "027_daydreamer"
        }
      ],
      "reply": {
        "residentId": "027_daydreamer",
        "text": "もふ？おひるねできる？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "027_daydreamer_002",
      "residentId": "027_daydreamer",
      "text": "ぼくはおやすみくん。おやすみをしてるんだ。前は工事現場で働いてたんだよ。",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "032_miner_001",
      "residentId": "032_miner",
      "text": "今日もまちをつくってきたもぐ！完成するのが楽しみだもぐ〜！",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "032_miner_002",
      "residentId": "032_miner",
      "text": "重たいものを持つときは、腰だけで持ち上げないように気をつけてるもぐ！",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "032_miner_003",
      "residentId": "032_miner",
      "text": "暑い日は、のどが渇く前に水分補給！休憩も忘れちゃだめだもぐ！",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "032_miner_004",
      "residentId": "032_miner",
      "text": "大きな建物だって、一日じゃできないもぐ。今日の一歩も、立派な積み重ねだもぐ！",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "032_miner_005",
      "residentId": "032_miner",
      "text": "おやすみくんとは一緒にはたらいてたんだよ。あの公園、ぼくたちがつくったんだ。",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "townTogether",
          "otherResidentId": "027_daydreamer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_001",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "拙者は猛者江戸（モサエド）というサムライにござる。よろしく頼むでござる！",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_002",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "足腰こそ武士の命！ 日々の鍛錬が肝要でござる",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_003",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "拙者のしっぽは、正直者でござる。",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_004",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "転ばぬ先の筋力でござる！",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "mission",
          "missionId": "strength",
          "minCount": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_005",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "今日もよき日でござるな！",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_006",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "むむっ、何やら楽しげな気配！",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_007",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "なでなで……？ ぶ、武士にそのような……もっと頼むでござる。",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_008",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "片足立ちも立派な修行でござるぞ。転ばぬよう、支えのある所でな。",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_009",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "歩くことは、未来の自分を守ることでござる。",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "mission",
          "missionId": "outside",
          "minCount": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_010",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "休む勇気も、武士の心得でござる。",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_011",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "あっぱれ！ 見事な働きでござる！",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "mission",
          "missionId": "all",
          "minCount": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_012",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "天晴れ、天晴れ！ 拙者も鼻が高い！",
      "priority": 20,
      "once": true,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "mission",
          "missionId": "all",
          "minCount": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_013",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "小さな一歩も、積もれば大功でござる！",
      "priority": 20,
      "once": true,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "mission",
          "missionId": "all",
          "minCount": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_014",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "その努力、拙者しかと見届けた！",
      "priority": 20,
      "once": true,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "mission",
          "missionId": "strength",
          "minCount": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_015",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "拙者、剣の道一筋！ ……おやつは別腹でござる。",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_016",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "敵かっ！？ ……なんだ、落ち葉でござった。",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_017",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "武士たるもの、弱音は……もふ、眠い。",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "036_mosa_018",
      "residentId": "036_mosa",
      "text": "刀の手入れは欠かさぬ。毛並みの手入れもな！",
      "priority": 10,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_001",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "うふふ、今日もごきげん麗しくね♡",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_002",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "あら、今日のあなた、いいお顔ね。鏡を見るたび、好きなところをひとつ見つけてちょうだい♡",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_003",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "シワはね、たくさん笑ってきた勲章なのよ。わたくし、けっこう気に入っているの♡",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_004",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "白髪を染めても、そのまま楽しんでもいいの。自分で選ぶおしゃれがいちばん素敵よ♪",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_005",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "お肌のお手入れは、やさしく洗って保湿するところから。高価なものをそろえなくてもいいのよ♡",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_006",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "日差しの強い日だけじゃなくて、普段のお出かけでも日焼け止めや帽子を忘れずにね。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_007",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "髪を整えたら、ちょっとお出かけしたくなるわね。近所をひと回りするのも気分転換になるわ♪",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_008",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "お気に入りのお洋服、しまいっぱなしはもったいないわ。今日着たっていいじゃない♡",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_009",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "お化粧する日もしない日も、どちらも素敵。自分が心地いいのがいちばんよ。",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_010",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "手が乾燥するときは、手洗いのあとにハンドクリームを。ちいさなご自愛ね♪",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_011",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "あら、寝ぐせ？ それも個性だけれど、ブラシを通すと気分が変わるかもしれないわね♡",
      "priority": 0,
      "once": false,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": []
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_012",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "お外へ出かけたのね！ おしゃれをして歩くのも、普段着で歩くのも、どちらも素敵よ♡",
      "priority": 20,
      "once": true,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "mission",
          "missionId": "outside",
          "minCount": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "035_beaty_013",
      "residentId": "035_beaty",
      "text": "5回もお出かけしたのね！ 好きな景色や人に会えたかしら？ 無理のないペースで楽しんでね♡",
      "priority": 30,
      "once": true,
      "logic": "all",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "type": "mission",
          "missionId": "outside",
          "minCount": 5
        }
